        "text": "# Parsing JSON\n\n**Parsing** means looking at a string of symbols and breaking it down into smaller, meaningful sections.\n\nWhen we **parse JSON**, we turn the raw data into JavaScript objects usable by our program.\n<br>\n<br>\n```\n{   \n     “name” : “Maria”,\n     “age”: 15,\n     “city”: “Los Angeles”\n     “photo”: “profile.png”\n}\n```\n",
